        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874770/extras/7ee71174fe560b19adb3f2b9b429570c.poster.avif?t=1767676631\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=128 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874770/extras/7ee71174fe560b19adb3f2b9b429570c.webm?t=1767676631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Pixel Tank Wars&quot; Is A Fast-Paced 2D Top-Down Twin-Stick Shooter That'S Easy To Pick Up, Quick To Play, And Full Of Laughs And Gunfire!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players Can Choose Their Own Tank Shape And Venue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports Stand-Alone Local Multiplayer And Steam Remote Play, Up To 4 People Can Participate In The Melee</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suitable For Family Fun, As Well As Gatherings Between Veterans And Friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Game Takes Only A Few Minutes, Which Is Convenient For Controlling The Playing Time. You Can Start A Game Whenever You Want.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Each Battle, Players Will Control The Tank To Shoot And Dodge Until There Is Only One Survivor Left On The Field Who Is The Winner!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Game Currently Offers 8 Maps, Each With A Different Style Of Environment And Interactive Scene Objects, Such As Obstacles And Props, To Increase The Variability And Fun Of The Battle.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874770/extras/7ee71174fe560b19adb3f2b9b429570c.poster.avif?t=1767676631\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=128 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874770/extras/7ee71174fe560b19adb3f2b9b429570c.webm?t=1767676631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Pixel Tank Wars&quot; Is A Fast-Paced 2D Top-Down Twin-Stick Shooter That'S Easy To Pick Up, Quick To Play, And Full Of Laughs And Gunfire!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players Can Choose Their Own Tank Shape And Venue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports Stand-Alone Local Multiplayer And Steam Remote Play, Up To 4 People Can Participate In The Melee</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suitable For Family Fun, As Well As Gatherings Between Veterans And Friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Game Takes Only A Few Minutes, Which Is Convenient For Controlling The Playing Time. You Can Start A Game Whenever You Want.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Each Battle, Players Will Control The Tank To Shoot And Dodge Until There Is Only One Survivor Left On The Field Who Is The Winner!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Game Currently Offers 8 Maps, Each With A Different Style Of Environment And Interactive Scene Objects, Such As Obstacles And Props, To Increase The Variability And Fun Of The Battle.</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "A Fast-Paced 2D Top-Down Twin-Stick Shooting Game Suitable For Both Children And Veterans. No Complicated Systems Or Lengthy Levels, Just Fast, Exciting, Laughter-Filled And Gunfire Multiplayer Battles!",
